			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1770304447515,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Horizontal Scaling for Network Bottlenecks\n\nNetwork bottleneck happens when:\nOne server NIC is saturated\n\nHorizontal scaling solution:\nSplit traffic across multiple machines\n\nExample:\n\nOne server NIC = 1 Gbps\nTraffic = 5 Gbps\n\nAdd 5 servers:\nEach handles ≈ 1 Gbps",
			"rawText": "Horizontal Scaling for Network Bottlenecks\n\nNetwork bottleneck happens when:\nOne server NIC is saturated\n\nHorizontal scaling solution:\nSplit traffic across multiple machines\n\nExample:\n\nOne server NIC = 1 Gbps\nTraffic = 5 Gbps\n\nAdd 5 servers:\nEach handles ≈ 1 Gbps",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "C1ne_hvGspmZ2pZfhboyv",
			"originalText": "Horizontal Scaling for Network Bottlenecks\n\nNetwork bottleneck happens when:\nOne server NIC is saturated\n\nHorizontal scaling solution:\nSplit traffic across multiple machines\n\nExample:\n\nOne server NIC = 1 Gbps\nTraffic = 5 Gbps\n\nAdd 5 servers:\nEach handles ≈ 1 Gbps",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
